#usda 1.0
(
    """
    The Matter parity rig's CHARACTER scene (generated by build_character.py; do not hand-edit).
    The CC0 MakeHuman body, one mesh per substance. st is in METRES per part (source UVs x the
    part's median density); a render job rescales st by the article's meters_per_tile.
    Hair, Brows and Lashes keep their source atlas st: their cut-out maps (cutouts/) are drawn on it.
    Lips: 1 UV unit = 1.276 m (p5 0.673, p95 1.788)
    Nails: 1 UV unit = 1.782 m (p5 1.700, p95 1.989)
    Body: 1 UV unit = 1.534 m (p5 0.708, p95 2.352)
    Cornea: 1 UV unit = 0.450 m (p5 0.264, p95 0.490)
    Pupil: 1 UV unit = 0.055 m (p5 0.054, p95 0.056)
    Iris: 1 UV unit = 0.051 m (p5 0.050, p95 0.055)
    Sclera: 1 UV unit = 0.126 m (p5 0.050, p95 0.167)
    Gums: 1 UV unit = 0.222 m (p5 0.203, p95 0.246)
    Teeth: 1 UV unit = 0.221 m (p5 0.196, p95 0.307)
    Tongue: 1 UV unit = 0.139 m (p5 0.106, p95 0.191)
    Trousers: 1 UV unit = 1.570 m (p5 1.106, p95 2.224)
    Shirt: 1 UV unit = 1.233 m (p5 1.027, p95 1.523)
    Shoes: 1 UV unit = 0.357 m (p5 0.288, p95 1.125)
    Hair: 1 UV unit = 0.940 m (p5 0.526, p95 1.395)
    Brows: 1 UV unit = 0.078 m (p5 0.050, p95 0.136)
    Lashes: 1 UV unit = 0.051 m (p5 0.050, p95 0.052)
