    mpfb_lips.jpg: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/makehumancommunity/mpfb2/3edf9df0551765be43563d047888cf7877eb89b4/src/mpfb/data/textures/mpfb_lips.jpg sha256 572630c2b4bb061dfd3b5bb75228615527442296b0db40feffffb0d439e8c203
    mpfb_fingernails.jpg: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/makehumancommunity/mpfb2/3edf9df0551765be43563d047888cf7877eb89b4/src/mpfb/data/textures/mpfb_fingernails.jpg sha256 0828222964a14c14a46e72445f549a2124de06f072daab71e5a6716324c37362
